                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "時來運轉 is a no-frills eatery serving local set lunches such as rice with deep fried prawns. Each set comes with free-flow drinks (green tea, red tea, with or without milk) and only costs around $130+.\nThe eatery was quite well-packed with locals at 2 pm even though it closes at 2.30 pm for a break before resuming dinner service.\nTaste-wise, the food was decently delicious. Service was polite.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
